**Convergence function:** `PostAsync` — `internal/webhook/webhook.go:184`

---

### Evidence

All outbound webhook HTTP goes through user-configured URLs loaded via `s.Store.GetUserWebhooks`, then enqueued by `webhook.PostAsync`. Background workers dequeue and call `Post`, which performs the actual `safeClient.Do(req)` HTTP POST (`internal/webhook/webhook.go:152`).

